@SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

### 1. Get all service requests
GET {{SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress}}/api/ServiceApi
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get service request by ID
GET {{SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress}}/api/ServiceApi/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a new service request
POST {{SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress}}/api/ServiceApi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Aarav Shah",
  "department": "Computer Engineering",
  "serviceType": "IT Support",
  "description": "Unable to login to the student portal",
  "priority": "High"
}

### 4. Update status of request 1
PUT {{SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress}}/api/ServiceApi/UpdateStatus/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 5. Delete request 2
DELETE {{SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress}}/api/ServiceApi/2

### 6. Validation error (empty body fields -> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{SmartCampusPortal_HostAddress}}/api/ServiceApi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "",
  "department": "",
  "serviceType": "Gym",
  "description": ""
}
